                   |
|               |           ProjectionExec: expr=[ss_ticket_number@0 as ss_ticket_number, ss_customer_sk@1 as ss_customer_sk, s_city@3 as s_city, sum(store_sales.ss_coupon_amt)@4 as amt, sum(store_sales.ss_net_profit)@5 as profit]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          